[node name="RichTextLabel2" type="RichTextLabel" parent="ScrollContainer/PanelContainer/VBoxContainer"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(800, 0)
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center]
[b][font_size=24]HOW TO PLAY - LOGIC LEVEL[/font_size][/b]

[b]Your Goal[/b]
This level focuses on [color=#ffeb3b]Boolean Logic[/color] (True or False).
Evaluate the expression to determine the correct path.

[b][font_size=20]How to Play[/font_size][/b]
1. An expression will appear (e.g., [code]5 > 3[/code])
2. Calculate if the statement is [b]TRUE[/b] or [b]FALSE[/b]
3. Drag the block to the matching gate/port
4. The correct decision powers the circuit!

[color=#6a9955]Tip: Remember that [code]![/code] means NOT (it flips the result).[/color]

[b][font_size=20]About This Level[/font_size][/b]
- Tests your ability to think like a computer
- Uses operators like [code]==[/code], [code]>[/code], [code]&&[/code] (AND), and [code]||[/code] (OR)
- There are only two possible answers here!

Good luck - trust your logic!
[/center]"
scroll_active = false

