[node name="RichTextLabel3" type="RichTextLabel" parent="ScrollContainer/PanelContainer/VBoxContainer"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(800, 0)
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center]
[b][font_size=24]HOW TO PLAY - FUNCTION LEVEL[/font_size][/b]

[b]Your Goal[/b]
This level focuses on using [color=#ffeb3b]Methods[/color] to process data.
Provide the correct inputs (arguments) to get the required result.

[b][font_size=20]How to Play[/font_size][/b]
1. Check what result the system needs (e.g., "Purple")
2. Find the correct ingredient blocks
3. Drag them inside the function's parentheses [code]( )[/code]
4. Execute the code to [b]Return[/b] the new value

[color=#6a9955]Tip: Functions are like recipes. The inputs are your ingredients.[/color]

[b][font_size=20]About This Level[/font_size][/b]
- You are acting as the "Caller" of the code
- Inputs must go in the correct order
- Watch how data transforms inside the machine

Good luck - get mixing!
[/center]"
scroll_active = false

